Third-party components bundled unmodified (never linked)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Virtual Display Driver (VirtualDrivers, "VDD by MTT") ...... MIT
    Windows IddCx virtual display behind "MoonlightWeb Virtual Display".
    Release 25.7.23, the bare driver package (inf + cat + dll) as published,
    committed under backend/installer/drivers/vdd and shipped inside the
    Windows installer; every file is pinned by SHA-256
    (backend/src/backend/VirtualDisplay.h) and re-hashed before install.
    Catalog signed by SignPath Foundation; that certificate is trusted only
    for the install. License: backend/installer/drivers/vdd/LICENSE.

  QR Code generator library (Project Nayuki) ................. MIT
    Draws the QR code a TV on plain HTTP shows to sign in. Release v1.8.0,
    the file qrcodegen-v1.8.0-es5.js as published, committed under
    frontend/js/vendor (SHA-256 348b0d876f9893f6f2bafae6c9d4ddb76b69651e214f
    2211034922a8207da3bf). Its MIT notice heads the file.

